  "source": ":- use_module(library(readutil)).\n\ngcd(A, 0, A) :-\n    A > 0.\ngcd(A, B, G) :-\n    B > 0,\n    R is A mod B,\n    gcd(B, R, G).\n\nremove_empty([], []).\nremove_empty([H|T], R) :-\n    ( H == \"\" ->\n        remove_empty(T, R)\n    ;\n        R = [H|R1],\n        remove_empty(T, R1)\n    ).\n\nmain :-\n    read_line_to_string(user_input, Line),\n    split_string(Line, \" \\t\\r\\n\", \" \\t\\r\\n\", Parts),\n    remove_empty(Parts, Tokens),\n    Tokens = [AStr, BStr|_],\n    atom_string(AA, AStr),\n    atom_number(AA, A),\n    atom_string(BA, BStr),\n    atom_number(BA, B),\n    gcd(A, B, G),\n    L is (A // G) * B,\n    format(\"~d~n~d~n\", [G, L]).",
